#: qml/MainPage.qml:73
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Contrast is the difference in luminance or color that makes an object (or "
"its representation in an image or display) distinguishable. In visual "
"perception of the real world, contrast is determined by the difference in "
"the color and brightness of the object and other objects within the same "
"field of view."
msgstr ""
"Kontrast je razlika u luminansi ili boji koja omogućava da se objekat (ili "
"njegov prikaz na slici ili ekranu) razlikuje. U vizuelnom opažanju stvarnog "
"sveta, kontrast je određen razlikom u boji i osvetljaju objekta i drugih "
"objekata u istom vidnom polju."

